/**
 * Era VII — The Long Night (10¹¹ → 10¹⁰⁰ years).
 *
 * The home galaxy alone, from its last red dwarfs to its last black hole. Hold on a black hole to
 * feed it from the stars around it; let go to spill the disk through its spin (the Penrose process),
 * best just before the Eddington limit. Steps are cosmological decades: the stars die, the dead stars
 * cool and boil away, the black holes evaporate one by one in final flashes, and the era ends in heat
 * death.
 */
